# Local Voice Bridge

Before any voice command (`cursor-speak`, `voice-chronicle`, `voice-target-*`, shell checks):

```bash
export VOICEBRIDGE_PROJECT_ROOT="/Users/danielgoldberg/Desktop/A1-Inter-LLM-Com/The-New-Fuse"
export VOICEBRIDGE_STATE_DIR="$VOICEBRIDGE_PROJECT_ROOT/.voicebridge"
export VOICE_BRIDGE_MODE="${VOICE_BRIDGE_MODE:-local}"
export VOICE_BRIDGE_LOCAL=1
unset VOICE_KWS_INGEST_URL VOICE_KWS_FLUSH_URL VOICE_KWS_API_KEY
```

Local state: `$VOICEBRIDGE_PROJECT_ROOT/.voicebridge` (chronicle, stream, targets).

Cloud KWS is **opt-in** only: `VOICE_BRIDGE_MODE=cloud` + `voice_bridge_cloud.env`.
